    {
      "title": "Expansion Update",
      "date": "2022-12-02 09:55:30",
      "url": "https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/4979322040020620034",
      "content": "Adds 2 news quests : Relam's Ashes and expansion, Winter's Ankh.\n\nFollow the backstory of the mad prophet Relam along his his preaching through the land.\n\nExpansion involves a 100 level puzzle pyramid, as well as a besieging storyline. \n\nYou can also play the expansion seperately from the main game, just watch the first demo.\n\n+ other improvements\n+ let me know if there are any bugs",
      "key": "2121850::63def5d9d66eafe5682eea31697e45a8e9bcf33b",
      "tags": null
    },
